<title>USA: Petrolite shareholders approve merger.</title>
<headline>Petrolite shareholders approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petrolite Corp said Tuesday more than 96 percent of shares which voted and 83 percent of all outstanding shares voted in favor of its agreement to be acquired by Baker Hughes Inc.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to close on July 2.</p>
<p>In February, the companies announced the planned stock swap valued at $693 million. The exact exchange ratio will be based on the average stock market price of Baker shares in the 10 days before the closing, the companies said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
